{
  "name": "crafter_ignores_qc",
  "description": "Quirk crafter-no-qc: one redstone block powers the spaces above a crafter and a dropper, which counts as power for the dropper (quasi-connectivity) but not for the crafter. A block placed beside the dropper updates it and it fires into its chest; a block placed beside the crafter updates it and it does nothing. Then a redstone block between them powers both directly: the crafter turns its oak log into planks in its chest, while the dropper, already triggered, stays still. When that block goes, the crafter resets and the dropper stays triggered.",
